              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu mwaka wa gatandatu, mu kwezi kwa gatandatu, ku musi ugira gatanu w’ukwo kwezi, nari nicaye mu nzu yanje, n’ abakuru b’i Buyuda bicaye imbere yanje: maz’ ukuboko kw’Umwami Uhoraho kunsūmirira hano nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 1:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngize ntya, mbona nk’ūfise ishusho isa n’umuriro; kand’ uhereye ahobaye mu rukenyerero rwiwe ugasubiza ahahera hepfo, yar’ umuriro: uhereye ahobaye mu rukenyerero rwiwe ugasubiza ahahera haruguru, hāsa n’ibica ibibatsi, biboneka nk’umuringa w’ umujumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
