            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw anshikana mu nyubakwa y’imbere yo ku ngoro y’ Uhoraho; maze mbona ku rugi rw’urusengero rw’Uhoraho, hagati y’umuryango n’igicaniro, abantu bashika nko kuri mirongwibiri na batanu, bateye ibitugu urusengero rw’Uhoraho, berekeje amaso i burasirazuba, kandi bāriko barasenga izuba, batumbereye iyo rirasira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
